  People,
    Zone1 People,                 !- Name  Kept: name chosen by the model.
    Zone1,                        !- Zone Name  Source: xlsx G2 Zone1.
    Occupancy Sched,              !- Number of People Schedule Name  Source: xlsx L12..N37 Occ_WD / Occ_WE.
    Area/Person,                  !- Number of People Calculation Method  Derived from xlsx G5 (unit m2/person).
    ,                             !- number of people
    ,                             !- people per floor area
    10000,                        !- Floor Area per Person  Source: xlsx G5 = 10000 m2/person (with 37.67 m2 = 0.003767 persons, practically none).
    ,                             !- fraction radiant
    ,                             !- sensible heat fraction
    Activity Level Sched;         !- Activity Level Schedule Name  Source: xlsx G6 = 70 W/person.

