    Cooling Setpoint Sched;       !- Cooling Setpoint Temperature Schedule Name  Source: xlsx I13:J37 (24 C).

  ZoneControl:Thermostat,
    Zone1 Thermostat,             !- Name
    Zone1,                        !- Zone or ZoneList Name
    HVACTemplate-Always 4,        !- Control Type Schedule Name
    ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint,!- Control Object Type  Source: xlsx F12 Building Temperature Set-point Schedule (heating and cooling set points).
    Zone1 Thermostat Dual SP Control;!- Control Name

