    Flow/Person,                  !- Outdoor Air Method  Derived from xlsx G9 (unit L/s per person).
    0.0;                          !- Outdoor Air Flow per Person {m3/s}  Source: xlsx G9 Outdoor Air = 0.0 L/s/person (the mechanical 20 L/s of C32 is in ZoneVentilation).

