    ,                             !- 2017 rated evaporator fan power per volume flow rate
    ,                             !- 2023 rated evaporator fan power per volume flow rate
    Zone1 PTHP Mixed Air Outlet,  !- Air Inlet Node Name
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil Outlet,!- Air Outlet Node Name
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil Cap-FT,!- Total Cooling Capacity Modifier Curve (function of temperature)
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil Cap-FF,!- Total Cooling Capacity Modifier Curve (function of flow fraction)
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil EIR-FT,!- Energy Input Ratio Modifier Curve (function of temperature)
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil EIR-FF,!- Energy Input Ratio Modifier Curve (function of flow fraction)
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil Coil PLF,!- Part Load Fraction Correlation (function of part load ratio)
    ,                             !- minimum outdoor dry bulb temperature for compressor operation
    ,                             !- nominal time for condensate removal to begin
    ,                             !- ratio of initial moisture evaporation rate and steady state latent capacity
    ,                             !- maximum cycling rate
    ,                             !- latent capacity time constant
    Zone1 PTHP Cooling Coil Condenser Inlet,!- Condenser Air Inlet Node Name
    ,                             !- condenser type
    0;                            !- Evaporative Condenser Effectiveness

  Curve:Quadratic,
