    0.0210526,                    !- Coefficient3 x**2  Derived from xlsx C22..C25.
    0.1,                          !- Minimum Value of x  Derived from xlsx C22..C25.
    1;                            !- Maximum Value of x  Derived from xlsx C22..C25.

